    "bodyHtml": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Jurnii 360 provides a live intelligence layer for the commercial floor. Built on what mid-managers and Heads-of need every Monday morning — not what looks good in a vendor brochure.</p>\n<h3>How Jurnii 360 Works</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Scope the competitor set</strong>: Together we agree the brands, markets, and verticals that matter. Typical scope: 5–20 brands across 1–4 jurisdictions.</li>\n<li><strong>Capture, daily</strong>: Public-facing pages, promo pages, and structured offer pages are captured at agreed frequency. Standard is daily; up to 4× daily for enterprise.</li>\n<li><strong>Structure &amp; enrich</strong>: Every offer is parsed into a structured schema — value, mechanic, wagering, qualifying odds, eligible games, segment, channel, and more.</li>\n<li><strong>Score &amp; benchmark</strong>: The promotion richness index normalises across mechanics so a £50 free bet can be compared to a £20 bonus + £10 free spins.</li>\n<li><strong>Surface &amp; alert</strong>: Insights land in a dashboard, in your Slack, in your email, or directly in your warehouse — whatever your team actually uses.</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "rawContent": "\n## Overview\n\nJurnii 360 provides a live intelligence layer for the commercial floor. Built on what mid-managers and Heads-of need every Monday morning — not what looks good in a vendor brochure.\n\n### How Jurnii 360 Works\n\n1. **Scope the competitor set**: Together we agree the brands, markets, and verticals that matter. Typical scope: 5–20 brands across 1–4 jurisdictions.\n2. **Capture, daily**: Public-facing pages, promo pages, and structured offer pages are captured at agreed frequency. Standard is daily; up to 4× daily for enterprise.\n3. **Structure & enrich**: Every offer is parsed into a structured schema — value, mechanic, wagering, qualifying odds, eligible games, segment, channel, and more.\n4. **Score & benchmark**: The promotion richness index normalises across mechanics so a £50 free bet can be compared to a £20 bonus + £10 free spins.\n5. **Surface & alert**: Insights land in a dashboard, in your Slack, in your email, or directly in your warehouse — whatever your team actually uses.\n"
