    "bodyHtml": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Cortex is an iGaming-native Media Mix Modelling engine built for operators. It models bonus mechanics, sporting events, regulatory changes, and competitive pressures to optimize acquisition and retention marketing budgets.</p>\n<h3>Implementation Process</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Data-Readiness Assessment</strong>: 12-point evaluation of spend granularity and KPI hygiene.</li>\n<li><strong>Ingestion &amp; Taxonomy</strong>: Consolidating spend, KPI, and exogenous market data into a unified model structure.</li>\n<li><strong>Bayesian Time-Series Modeling</strong>: Calibrated with commercial priors for transparent ROI curves.</li>\n<li><strong>Quarterly Optimization &amp; Refresh</strong>: Iterative model updates incorporating new campaigns and market shifts.</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "rawContent": "\n## Overview\n\nCortex is an iGaming-native Media Mix Modelling engine built for operators. It models bonus mechanics, sporting events, regulatory changes, and competitive pressures to optimize acquisition and retention marketing budgets.\n\n### Implementation Process\n\n1. **Data-Readiness Assessment**: 12-point evaluation of spend granularity and KPI hygiene.\n2. **Ingestion & Taxonomy**: Consolidating spend, KPI, and exogenous market data into a unified model structure.\n3. **Bayesian Time-Series Modeling**: Calibrated with commercial priors for transparent ROI curves.\n4. **Quarterly Optimization & Refresh**: Iterative model updates incorporating new campaigns and market shifts.\n"
